[32.463112, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[2G\u001b[38;5;174m▝▝   ▝▝ \u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;241m~/bare-app\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;5;255m\u001b[38;5;248m❯ \u001b[38;5;16mFinance says our money rounding is wrong: div_cents() in \u001b[39m           \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mapp/money.py drops fractions of a cent, but amounts must round half\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;16mup (for\u001b[11Gexample,\u001b[20G7% tax \u001b[28Gn 1050\u001b[35Gcents must be 74 cents, not 73). \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btests/t\u001b[11Gst_money.py pins the\u001b[32Grequir\u001b[39Gd behaviour; you can\u001b[61Gun it \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16mwith \u001b[38;5;105mpython3 -m pytest tests/test_money.py\u001b[38;5;16m. Fix it and tell\u001b[63Gme when\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bit i\u001b[8G done. Do not commit; do not push.\u001b[39m                         \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[39m I'll fix the rounding issue in \u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[39m. Let me first check the\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btest\u001b[8Gfile\u001b[13Gto\u001b[16Gunderstand\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31Grequired\u001b[40Gbehavior,\u001b[50Gthen\u001b[55Glook\u001b[60Gat\u001b[63Gthe\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gcurrent implementation.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m files, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;16m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNow I understand the issue. The \u001b[38;5;105mdiv_cents()\u001b[39m function uses integer\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdivision\u001b[12Gwhich\u001b[18Gtruncates,\u001b[29Gbut\u001b[33Git\u001b[36Gneeds\u001b[42Gto\u001b[45Gimplement\u001b[55G\"round\u001b[62Ghalf\u001b[67Gup\"\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gl\u001b[5Ggic. For 7350 / 100, it should return 74 (not 73).\u001b[56G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BLet me\u001b[10Gfix\u001b[14Git using the round-half-up formula:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;241m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(\u001b]8;id=h30f5e;file:///root/bare-app/app/money.py\u0007app/money.py\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[K\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
